Subject: win32u: GDI scaling ("System (Enhanced)") and font fixes from moeleak/wine
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later
Modification date: 2026-11-22

The gdi-scaling branch of github:moeleak/wine (on Wine 11.18), backported to
CrossOver 26.3's Wine 11.0, whose DPIs are integers rather than ratios. GDI-scaled
windows (the GDIDPISCALING AppCompatFlags layer, or a gdiScaling manifest in a
DPI-unaware process) draw their window DCs at an integer multiple of the window
DPI on high-DPI monitors, so that GDI text and menus are rendered sharp instead of
stretched; GdiScaleFactor overrides the scale. With fonts hinted the way the host
renders text, and the named instances of variable fonts exposed as GDI faces.
Its gdi32 font test of the named instances is left out.

Commits, in order (moeleak/wine):
  fe8ed09d56 user32/tests: Test the DPI awareness context of GDI-scaled windows.
  d95c2971df win32u: Support the GDIDPISCALING AppCompatFlags layer.
  5fa47cde85 user32: Use GDI scaling for manifests requesting gdiScaling in DPI-unaware processes.
  7a9a7dec35 win32u: Add a non-locking default process DPI awareness context.
  46c30c4c84 user32: Default to GDI scaling for gdiScaling manifests without DPI awareness.
  73dd8648bc user32/tests: Add app-visible invariance tests for GDI-scaled window DCs.
  7547e80ef1 win32u: Add a region scaling helper.
  576d1a805a win32u: Introduce a hidden raster scale on DCs.
  d4d36a47a9 win32u: Compute blit and DIB transfer rectangles in raster coordinates.
  5b88507bc4 win32u: Rasterize DIB engine primitives in raster coordinates.
  ac81710be5 win32u: Draw thin pens as pixel blocks on raster-scaled DCs.
  0a098bc6d2 win32u: Scale hatch and pattern brushes on raster-scaled DCs.
  36c4eda81e win32u: Realize a render font at the raster scale.
  4fa9323115 win32u: Render text at the raster scale in the DIB engine.
  ac40289308 win32u: Support an integer pixel scale in scaled window surfaces. (backported)
  fef764da62 win32u: Map window surface rects and regions through the surface scale. (backported)
  ff3f0464f2 win32u: Rasterize window DCs at the scale of their window surface.
  64c37f30a8 win32u: Add a GDI scaling policy with a GdiScaleFactor override.
  d4d2ec1e30 win32u: Enable GDI scaling for GDI-scaled windows on high-DPI monitors. (backported)
  bd68df5891 win32u: Center raster scaled glyphs on their unscaled advances.
  db777165a6 win32u: Read the host hint style from fontconfig and allow internal callers to request it.
  a231c3fe95 win32u: Hint the glyphs of render fonts the way the host renders text.
  fea0785a2c win32u: Blend raster scaled host-hinted glyphs with linear coverage.
  297ee95ad6 win32u: Use the collection member index to find a TTC member's offset.
  1a200d10f2 win32u: Keep the family name when loading the font cache.
  f6dd9e7502 win32u: Don't overflow the value name buffer in update_external_font_keys.
  ee93d4a2d0 win32u: Allow enumerating any name ID of the OpenType name table.
  b83ef6876e win32u: Avoid reading past the end of the font data when looking up OpenType tables.
  e8e83946d2 win32u: Parse the named instances of variable fonts.
  6e80e82b8e win32u: Report the weight and style of variable font instance faces from the face.
  452b54d9dc win32u: Expose the named instances of variable fonts as GDI faces.
  a6e6120ae8 win32u: Name variable font instances from their STAT axis values.

